  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-computer-use",
      "text": "Windows Computer Use tools for DeepSeek Harness. The plugin combines:\n\n- Windows window discovery and foreground input;\n- UI Automation element discovery and focus state;\n- window screenshots;\n- ModLens-compatible 3x3 visual grounding;\n- observation-bound element/coordinate actions;\n- DeepSeek Harness one-shot approval prompts for risky actions."
    },
    {
      "section": "Why the grid exists",
      "text": "ModLens deliberately returns semantic evidence rather than invented bounding\nboxes. `computer_observe` therefore produces an annotated A1-C3 screenshot.\nFor a custom UI, call `modlens_read_image` on `grid_screenshot_path`, select the\nreported cell with `computer_zoom`, and repeat until the region is small enough\nto click. Standard controls should use the UI Automation `element_index` path."
    },
    {
      "section": "Apps without an accessibility tree (WeChat, Electron, …)",
      "text": "Self-drawn UIs such as WeChat expose an empty accessibility tree, so\n`element_index` navigation is unavailable. Use the screenshot path instead:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Apps without an accessibility tree (WeChat, Electron, …)",
      "text": "1. `computer_observe` returns a `grid_screenshot_path`. If a window renders\n   blank on first capture (it was still activating or was occluded), the native\n   helper re-activates it and retries before falling back to a screen copy; a\n   still-occluded window now fails with a clear error instead of silently\n   returning a screenshot of the wrong window.\n2. Call `modlens_read_image` on the grid, pick an A1-C3 cell, `computer_zoom`,\n   and repeat until the region is small. ModLens can time out or be imprecise:\n   retry the read, and cross-check with `computer_zoom` rather than trusting a\n   single grid answer.\n3. WeChat hides to tray without minimizing: wake it with `computer_hotkey`\n   `ctrl+alt+w` (or `computer_tray`) before observing, instead of relying on\n   the helper to reveal a blank window."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```powershell"
    },
    {
      "section": "从 npm 安装",
      "text": "npx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-computer-use-windows"
    },
    {
      "section": "或从 GitHub 安装",
      "text": "npx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add github:nanbbb/dsh-computer-use-windows\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Build from source",
      "text": "```powershell\nnpm run verify\nnpm pack\nnpx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add C:\\absolute\\path\\to\\dsh-computer-use-windows-0.2.1.tgz\n```\n\nRestart DeepSeek Harness after installation. Keep `@liustack/modlens` enabled;\nthis plugin does not duplicate or replace its vision provider."
    },
    {
      "section": "Example task",
      "text": "> Use Computer Use to open the existing Calculator window and calculate 19 × 7.\n> Do not operate any other application.\n\nThe model should call `computer_list_windows`, choose exactly one returned\nwindow, call `computer_observe`, act once, and observe again."
    },
    {
      "section": "Safety model",
      "text": "Risky calls use the Harness approval service. Missing approval support fails\nclosed. On-screen instructions never count as user authorization. The native\nhelper refuses invisible windows, invalid handles, out-of-window points,\npassword controls, terminal windows, authentication UI, and locked desktops.\n\n完整的安全模型见 [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "| 字段 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `observationTtlMs` | `120000` | 观测快照有效期（毫秒），过期后 `element_index` / 坐标失效 |\n| `maxAccessibilityElements` | `300` | 单次观测返回的 UI Automation 元素上限 |\n| `screenshotDirectory` | `auto` | 截图输出目录；`auto` = 系统临时目录 |\n| `requireApprovalForTyping` | `false` | 为 `true` 时所有打字强制走审批 |\n| `allowedApps` | `[]` | 白名单；非空时只允许这些进程名（不含 `.exe`，如 `[\"notepad\",\"chrome\"]`），其余全部拒绝 |\n| `allowedExternalLabels` | `[]` | 允许降级「发送/提交」类标签的名单（子串匹配，不区分大小写，如 `[\"发送\",\"send\"]`）。命中时按模型的显式 `risk` 处理；**仅 external 类可放行，删除/支付/登录永远升级** |"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "This is an MVP for Windows 10/11 x64 and is fully self-contained — the\nbundled native helper ships its own .NET runtime, so no separate install is\nrequired."
    },
    {
      "section": "Interaction model",
      "text": "Actions activate (bring to foreground) the target window before clicking,\ntyping, or pressing keys. This is a foreground mode: while the agent operates\na window, that window takes the foreground and the physical mouse moves to the\naction point. It does not run in the background. Keep this in mind if you need\nto use the machine while the agent is working."
    }
  ],
